       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EVAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 N PIC 9 VALUE 3.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           EVALUATE N
               WHEN 1 DISPLAY "ONE"
               WHEN 2 WHEN 3 DISPLAY "TWO-THREE"
               WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "X"
           END-EVALUATE.
           STOP RUN.
